These systems learn reusable libraries by **abstracting common structure across a corpus of programs**.

From the documents:

- “**learning libraries of program abstractions which capture reusable structure across a corpus of programs**”
- “**search for common tree fragments across a corpus of programs, which can be introduced as new abstractions**”
- Ellis et al. 2021 “**reasons about variable bindings to abstract out well-formed functions instead of just tree fragments**”

So, in short, they identify repeated patterns in many programs and turn those patterns into abstractions that can be reused in new programs.

